{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064897/block/singleImage/3273582/df/01M7W4V523EQYETACYB8672V5J.png?updatedAt=1795167239\"/><figcaption>一名工人於深水埗運動場對開地盤進行工程期間發現懷疑炸彈。警方發現一枚二戰時期英式迫擊砲彈。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日（20日）下午近1時，一名工人於深水埗運動場對開地盤進行工程期間，發現懷疑炸彈。警方接報到場，於上址發現一枚二戰時期英式迫擊砲彈，長約24厘米，直徑約5厘米。爆炸品處理課人員到場調查，發現該枚英式迫擊砲彈內沒有殘餘炸藥，其後將其銷毀安全處理，事件中無人受傷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:00.982443+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:58:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T17:37:35.705363+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:16.879324+00:00","content_hash":"632840f78506442b73406ddf4ce9499163157e1fbe7a7f1623e5d4a29d733d24","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:00.982443+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}